Original change's description:
> Fix iteration in SVGDocumentResourceTracker::DisposeUnobserved()
>
> The tracked_resources_ set could potentially be mutated by the disposal
> of a SVGResourceDocumentContent, so make a copy before iterating.
>
> Since SVGDocumentResourceTracker::Dispose() could potentially suffer
> from a similar issue, adjust it too.
>
> Fixed: 570050934
